        <mxCell id="notes" value="IMPORT CONTRACT&#10;• Each CSV row is one item; sale_id groups a transaction. Product IDs are unique within a company.&#10;• Required columns: sale_id, date_time, product_id, product, category, quantity, unit_price, unit_cost.&#10;• One file belongs to the selected company. A sale cannot mix companies or transaction timestamps.&#10;• Quantity must be a positive integer; prices/costs must be finite and nonnegative; reject invalid or missing values.&#10;• Reject duplicate (sale_id, product_id) rows; aggregate units into quantity before import. Validate the whole file before creating objects.&#10;• Historical unit prices/costs belong to SaleItem. Filtered datasets may reference the same sales." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#243247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
