        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="CALCULATION RULES&#10;Financial: revenue, cost, gross profit, gross margin and average order value per distinct sale_id.&#10;For zero revenue, gross margin is undefined; for zero sales, average order value is undefined.&#10;Products: quantity/revenue rankings among products present in the selected sales; unsold catalog products are excluded initially.&#10;Temporal: daily, weekly, monthly or yearly totals; peak hour by number of distinct transactions. Use one company time zone.&#10;Pandas/NumPy support calculations; Matplotlib renders charts. Libraries are not additional domain entities." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#243247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="990" width="1460" height="180" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
