        <mxCell id="legend" value="INHERITANCE&#10;Hollow triangle points to the base class.&#10;&#10;ASSOCIATION&#10;Solid line connects related objects.&#10;An open arrow indicates navigation.&#10;Without an arrow, navigation is unspecified.&#10;&#10;COMPOSITION&#10;Filled diamond is at the whole.&#10;A part belongs to at most one whole&#10;at a time; its lifecycle follows that whole.&#10;&#10;DEPENDENCY&#10;Dashed line with an open arrow points&#10;to the class being used.&#10;&#10;MULTIPLICITY&#10;1 = exactly one&#10;0..1 = zero or one&#10;0..* = zero or many&#10;1..* = one or many&#10;Read the number next to a class as&#10;how many of its objects may be linked&#10;to one object at the opposite end." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#243247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="150" width="470" height="810" />
