        <mxCell id="n" value="EXTENSION RULES&#10;• Catalog repositories use the same database as sales repositories. Company deletion with sales is rejected.&#10;• MainWindow also uses SalesService, Analysis, ChartGenerator and ReportExporter (pages 2–3).&#10;• A report references exactly one company; a company can have zero or many reports.&#10;• Period comparison runs on the same company dataset. Percentage change is undefined when the baseline is zero.&#10;• Sale items retain historical prices/costs; catalog edits never recalculate historical revenue.&#10;• UI widgets and transaction/session wiring are implementation details to refine during their delivery stage." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#243247;">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="970" width="490" height="245" />
        </mxCell>
